<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45000" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spīcĕus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		spica, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>consisting of ears of corn</i> (<b>poet.</b>
			and in post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corona,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					1, 1, 16</span></i>
			 (24); <i><span class="en">Hor. C. S. 30</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 2,
				2, § 6</span></i>; Sabin. Massur. ap. <i><span class="en">Gell. 6, 7,
				8</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">serta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					1, 10, 22</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov.
				M. 2, 28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 433</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Am. 3,
				10, 36</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Claud. B. Gild.
			136</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">messis,</span>”
				i. e. <i>of grain</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 314</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frux, Aus. Monos. de Cibis: coma,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the ears</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				4</span></i>
			 (5), 2, 14.</div>
